# Production frontend config — EXAMPLE ONLY, do not commit a filled-in copy.
# The real value lives in the hosting dashboard (Vercel > Project >
# Settings > Environment Variables) because VITE_* variables are
# baked into the build at build time: changing the backend URL means
# redeploying the frontend, not editing this file.
#
# VITE_API_URL = backend origin ONLY: scheme + host, no path, no
# trailing slash. The app appends /api/health, /api/analyze, etc.
# WRONG: https://gaplens-backend.onrender.com/api  (double /api)
# WRONG: https://gaplens-backend.onrender.com/     (trailing slash breaks nothing, but keep it clean)
# RIGHT: https://gaplens-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=https://<your-render-backend>.onrender.com
